# ALLOWLIST: ignore everything in ~/.claude by default and name only what is
# portable. Claude Code keeps adding runtime folders here (caches, transcripts,
# plugin downloads, sessions, backups, memory); an allowlist keeps every one of
# them out automatically. Never allowlist: settings.json (holds tokens),
# .credentials.json, .claude.json, projects/ (transcripts + memory), history*.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/CLAUDE.md
!/RTK.md
!/apply-model-ceiling.py
!/settings.portable.json
!/skills-manifest.txt
!/agents/
!/hooks/
!/scripts/
!/skills/
# only your own skills; symlinked/third-party ones are listed in skills-manifest.txt
/skills/*
!/skills/shipping-to-merge/
!/skills/graphify/
